="5.602">in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的爱曾像我居住的城市一样冷漠无情</span></p><p begin="7.503" end="11.477" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.503" end="8.004">Eve</span><span begin="8.087" end="8.613">ry</span><span begin="8.740" end="9.097">one</span> <span begin="9.097" end="9.470">loo</span><span begin="9.470" end="9.659">ked</span> <span begin="9.940" end="10.245">worse</span> <span begin="10.245" end="10.385">in</span> <span begin="10.385" end="10.599">the</span> <span begin="10.599" end="11.477">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在光芒的照耀下 每个人看起来更糟了</span></p><p begin="12.785" end="18.344" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.785" end="12.956">There</span> <span begin="12.956" end="13.115">are</span> <span begin="13.115" end="13.383">so</span> <span begin="13.383" end="13.758">many</span> <span begin="13.758" end="14.355">lines</span> <span begin="14.571" end="14.879">that</span> <span begin="15.160" end="15.472">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="15.510" end="16.103">crossed</span> <span begin="16.135" end="16.573">un</span><span begin="16.600" end="16.981">for</span><span begin="17.072" end="17.762">giv</span><span begin="17.762" end="18.344">en</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我触犯了太多不可原谅的底线</span></p><p begin="19.989" end="24.138" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.989" end="20.190">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="20.238" end="20.838">tell</span> <span begin="20.940" end="21.346">you</span> <span begin="21.565" end="21.788">the</span> <span begin="21.788" end="22.431">truth,</span> <span begin="22.606" end="22.824">but</span> <span begin="22.824" end="23.011">nev</span><span begin="23.011" end="23.200">er</span> <span begin="23.200" end="23.420">good</span><span begin="23.420" end="24.138">bye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会向你说明真相 但别因此跟我说再见</span></p></div><div begin="26.777" end="50.523" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="26.777" end="30.899" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.777" end="27.057">I</span> <span begin="27.057" end="27.242">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="27.242" end="27.475">wan</span><span begin="27.475" end="27.604">na</span> <span begin="27.604" end="27.774">look</span> <span begin="27.774" end="28.028">at</span> <span begin="28.028" end="28.372">any</span><span begin="28.372" end="28.803">thing</span> <span begin="28.803" end="29.175">else</span> <span begin="29.175" end="29.437">now</span> <span begin="29.437" end="29.632">that</span> <span begin="29.632" end="29.884">I</span> <span begin="29.884" end="30.407">saw</span> <span begin="30.407" end="30.899">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">遇见你之后 我眼中再无他人</span></p><p begin="33.143" end="37.267" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.143" end="33.430">I</span> <span begin="33.430" end="33.622">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="33.622" end="33.793">wan</span><span begin="33.793" end="33.999">na</span> <span begin="33.999" end="34.201">think</span> <span begin="34.201" end="34.445">of</span> <span begin="34.445" end="34.684">any</span><span begin="34.684" end="35.188">thing</span> <span begin="35.188" end="35.577">else</span> <span begin="35.577" end="35.816">now</span> <span begin="35.816" end="36.017">that</span> <span begin="36.017" end="36.381">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="36.381" end="36.649">thought</span> <span begin="36.649" end="36.845">of</span> <span begin="36.845" end="37.267">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想到你之后 我脑中再无他想</span></p><p begin="39.780" end="43.847" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.780" end="39.960">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="39.960" end="40.259">been</span> <span begin="40.259" end="40.558">sleep</span><span begin="40.558" end="40.680">ing</span> <span begin="40.680" end="41.067">so</span> <span begin="41.129" end="41.600">long</span> <span begin="41.600" end="41.741">in</span> <span begin="41.741" end="41.873">a</span> <span begin="41.873" end="42.164">twen</span><span begin="42.164" end="42.379">ty-</span><span begin="42.379" end="42.673">year</span> <span begin="42.733" end="43.131">dark</span> <span begin="43.176" end="43.847">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在黑夜中沉睡了二十年</span></p><p begin="44.983" end="47.224" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.983" end="45.177">And</span> <span begin="45.177" end="45.360">now</span> <span begin="45.360" end="45.544">I</span> <span begin="45.544" end="45.968">see</span> <span begin="45.968" end="46.355">day</span><span begin="46.411" end="47.224">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在 我终于迎来了曙光</span></p><p begin="48.176" end="50.523" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.176" end="48.315">I</span> <span begin="48.402" end="48.545">on</span><span begin="48.545" end="48.688">ly</span> <span begin="48.688" end="49.154">see</span> <span begin="49.199" end="49.592">day</span><span begin="49.614" end="50.523">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的眼里只有曙光</span></p></div><div begin="51.473" end="1:16.186" itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="51.473" end="56.771" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.473" end="51.791">Luck</span> <span begin="51.791" end="51.997">of</span> <span begin="51.997" end="52.150">the</span> <span begin="52.150" end="52.691">draw</span> <span begin="52.953" end="53.557">on</span><span begin="53.620" end="53.867">ly</span> <span begin="53.915" end="54.532">draws</span> <span begin="54.605" end="55.133">the</span> <span begin="55.180" end="55.566">un</span><span begin="55.566" end="56.090">lu</span><span begin="56.147" end="56.771">cky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">听天由命 只会招致厄运</span></p><p begin="58.537" end="1:03.028" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.537" end="58.710">And</span> <span begin="58.710" end="59.307">so</span> <span begin="59.353" end="59.801">I</span> <span begin="59.985" end="1:00.217">be</span><span begin="1:00.318" end="1:00.786">came</span> <span begin="1:00.975" end="1:01.167">the</span> <span begin="1:01.167" end="1:01.393">butt</span> <span begin="1:01.393" end="1:01.550">of</span> <span begin="1:01.550" end="1:01.725">the</span> <span begin="1:01.725" end="1:02.501">jo</span><span begin="1:02.599" end="1:03.028">ke</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">于是我沦为了笑柄</span></p><p begin="1:04.144" end="1:09.766" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.144" end="1:04.380">I</span> <span begin="1:04.380" end="1:04.558">wound</span><span begin="1:04.558" end="1:04.751">ed</span> <span begin="1:04.751" end="1:04.959">the</span> <span begin="1:04.959" end="1:05.513">good</span> <span begin="1:05.709" end="1:06.293">and</span> <span begin="1:06.349" end="1:06.600">I</span> <span begin="1:06.678" end="1:07.420">trust</span><span begin="1:07.420" end="1:07.779">ed</span> <span begin="1:07.996" end="1:08.397">the</span> <span begin="1:08.397" end="1:08.960">wi</span><span begin="1:08.960" end="1:09.552">ck</span><span begin="1:09.552" end="1:09.766">ed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我伤害了好人 错信了小人</span></p><p begin="1:11.510" end="1:16.186" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.510" end="1:12.061">Clear</span><span begin="1:12.173" end="1:12.669">ing</span> <span begin="1:12.759" end="1:13.097">the</span> <span begin="1:13.160" end="1:13.606">air,</span> <span begin="1:13.781" end="1:13.995">I</span> <span begin="1:13.995" end="1:14.403">breathed</span> <span begin="1:14.403" end="1:15.031">in</span> <span begin="1:15.031" end="1:15.197">the</span> <span begin="1:15.197" end="1:16.022">smo</span><span begin="1:16.022" end="1:16.186">ke</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想要消除误会 却卷入纷争</span></p></div><div begin="1:18.204" end="1:30.781" itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="1:18.204" end="1:21.154" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.204" end="1:18.504">Maybe</span> <