<span begin="1:26.594" end="1:26.758">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:26.790" end="1:27.009">morn</span><span begin="1:27.009" end="1:27.233">ing</span> <span begin="1:27.233" end="1:27.706">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在天亮了 我们抛下斗篷与武器吧</span></p><p begin="1:28.147" end="1:30.781" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.147" end="1:28.366">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:28.366" end="1:28.868">brighter</span> <span begin="1:28.868" end="1:29.496">now,</span> <span begin="1:30.042" end="1:30.781">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">现在 现在 天更亮了</span></p></div><div begin="1:30.801" end="2:06.396" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="1:30.801" end="1:38.391" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.801" end="1:30.978">I</span> <span begin="1:30.978" end="1:31.194">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:31.194" end="1:31.393">wan</span><span begin="1:31.393" end="1:31.585">na</span> <span begin="1:31.585" end="1:31.794">look</span> <span begin="1:31.794" end="1:31.983">at</span> <span begin="1:31.983" end="1:32.314">any</span><span begin="1:32.392" end="1:32.808">thing</span> <span begin="1:32.808" end="1:33.196">else</span> <span begin="1:33.196" end="1:33.406">now</span> <span begin="1:33.406" end="1:33.599">that</span> <span begin="1:33.599" end="1:33.862">I</span> <span begin="1:33.862" end="1:34.414">saw</span> <span begin="1:34.414" end="1:34.992">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">遇见你之后 我眼中再无他人</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:35.582" end="1:38.391"><span begin="1:35.582" end="1:35.719">(I</span> <span begin="1:35.719" end="1:35.958">could</span> <span begin="1:35.958" end="1:36.170">nev</span><span begin="1:36.170" end="1:36.374">er</span> <span begin="1:36.374" end="1:36.565">look</span> <span begin="1:36.565" end="1:36.783">a</span><span begin="1:36.783" end="1:38.391">way)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我再也无法移开视线</span></span></p><p begin="1:37.170"