nd="3:06.784">see</span> <span begin="3:06.784" end="3:07.116">day</span><span begin="3:07.197" end="3:07.780">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而现在 我终于迎来了曙光</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:07.869" end="3:09.590"><span begin="3:07.869" end="3:08.322">(See</span> <span begin="3:08.361" end="3:08.779">day</span><span begin="3:08.779" end="3:09.590">light)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曙光</span></span></p><p begin="3:09.010" end="3:13.278" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.010" end="3:09.186">I</span> <span begin="3:09.186" end="3:09.379">on</span><span begin="3:09.379" end="3:09.476">ly</span> <span begin="3:09.476" end="3:09.978">see</span> <span begin="3:09.978" end="3:10.328">day</span><span begin="3:10.383" end="3:11.059">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的眼里只有曙光</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:11.390" end="3:13.278"><span begin="3:11.390" end="3:12.193">(Oh,</span> <span begin="3:12.193" end="3:13.278">huh)</span></span></p><p begin="3:12.151" end="3:17.041" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.151" end="3:12.383">I</span> <span begin="3:12.383" end="3:12.579">on</span><span begin="3:12.579" end="3:12.696">ly</span> <span begin="3:12.696" end="3:13.181">see</span> <span begin="3:13.181" end="3:13.580">day</span><span begin="3:13.580" end="3:13.933">light,</span> <span begin="3:13.983" end="3:14.378">day</span><span begin="3:14.378" end="3:14.724">light,</span> <span begin="3:14.792" end="3:15.163">day</span><span begin="3:15.163" end="3:15.529">light,</span> <span begin="3:15.529" end="3:15.977">day</span><span begin="3:15.977" end="3:17.041">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的眼里只有曙光 曙光 曙光 曙光</span></p><p begin="3:18.553" end="3:23.201" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.553" end="3:18.777">I</span> <span begin="3:18.777" end="3:19.000">on</span><span begin="3:19.000" end="3:19.121">ly</span> <span begin="3: