往返于纽约</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切仍历历在目在我脑海中清晰可见 往返于纽约</span></span></p><p begin="3:31.362" end="3:36.869" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.362" end="3:31.586">I</span> <span begin="3:31.586" end="3:31.755">on</span><span begin="3:31.755" end="3:31.916">ly</span> <span begin="3:31.916" end="3:32.400">see</span> <span begin="3:32.400" end="3:32.791">day</span><span begin="3:32.791" end="3:33.176">light,</span> <span begin="3:33.176" end="3:33.588">day</span><span begin="3:33.588" end="3:33.957">light,</span> <span begin="3:33.995" end="3:34.413">day</span><span begin="3:34.413" end="3:34.796">light,</span> <span begin="3:34.796" end="3:35.140">day</span><span begin="3:35.180" end="3:35.927">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的眼里只有曙光 曙光 曙光 曙光</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:32.993" end="3:36.869"><span begin="3:32.993" end="3:33.159">(I</span> <span begin="3:33.159" end="3:33.391">once</span> <span begin="3:33.391" end="3:33.561">be</span><span begin="3:33.561" end="3:33.935">lieved</span> <span begin="3:33.982" end="3:34.152">lo</span><span begin="3:34.152" end="3:34.208">ve</span> <span begin="3:34.208" end="3:34.372">would</span> <span begin="3:34.405" end="3:34.743">be</span> <span begin="3:34.795" end="3:34.985">burn</span><span begin="3:34.985" end="3:35.160">ing</span> <span begin="3:35.160" end="3:36.869">red)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾以为爱情是 炽热的红色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾以为爱情是炽热的红色</span></span></p></div><div begin="3:40.809" end="4:28.809" itunes:song-part="Outro"><p begin="3:40.809" end="3:42.316" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.809" end="3:41.071">Like</span> <span begin="3:41.127" end="3:41.632">day</span><span begin="3:41.632" end="3:42.316">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如同曙光</span></p><p begin="3:44.987" end="3:49.606" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:44.987" end="3:45.188">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:45.188" end="3:45.776">gold</span><span begin="3:45.776" end="3:46.281">en</span> <span begin="3:48.010" end="3:48.305">like</span> <span begin="3:48.345" end="3:48.810">day</span><span begin="3:48.911" end="3:49.606">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">金色的 如同曙光</span></p><p begin="3:50.950" end="3:53.412" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.950" end="3:51.151">You&apos;ve</span> <span begin="3:51.151" end="3:51.306">got</span><span begin="3:51.306" end="3:51.492">ta</span> <span begin="3:51.492" end="3:51.725">step</span> <span begin="3:51.725" end="3:52.153">into</span> <span begin="3:52.153" end="3:52.332">the</span> <span begin="3:52.332" end="3:52.778">day</span><span begin="3:52.778" end="3:53.412">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你必须踏入曙光之中</span></p><p begin="3:53.824" end="3:55.078" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:53.824" end="3:53.992">And</span> <span begin="3:53.992" end="3:54.207">let</span> <span begin="3:54.207" end="3:54.426">it</span> <span begin="3:54.426" end="3:55.078">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">放下过去</span></p><p begin="3:57.010" end="3:58.494" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:57.010" end="3:57.220">Just</span> <span begin="3:57.220" end="3:57.448">let</span> <span begin="3:57.448" end="3:57.643">it</span> <span begin="3:57.643" end="3:58.494">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就放下过去</span></p><p begin="4:00.377" end="4:01.972" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:00.377" end="4:00.598">Let</span> <span begin="4:00.598" end="4:00.822">it</span> <span begin="4:00.822" end="4:01.972">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">放下过去</span></p><p begin="4:10.755" end="4:13.504" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:10.755" end="4:10.868">I</span> <span begin="4:10.868" end="4:10.951">wan</span><span begin="4:10.951" end="4:11.019">na</span> <span begin="4:11.056" end="4:11.151">be</span> <span begin="4:11.151" end="4:11.226">de</span><span begin="4:11.226" end="4:11.603">fined</span> <span begin="4:11.603" end="4:12.158">by</span> <span begin="4:12.184" end="4:12.360">the</span> <span begin="4:12.360" end="4:12.722">things</span> <span begin="4:12.722" end="4:12.803">that</span> <span begin="4:12.803" end="4:12.961">I</span> <span begin="4:13.008" end="4:13.295">lo</span><span begin="4:13.295" end="4:13.504">ve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望以我喜爱的事物定义自己</span></p><p begin="4:14.406" end="4:15.360" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:14.406" end="4:14.535">Not</span> <span begin="4:14.535" end="4:14.699">the</span> <span begin="4:14.699" end="4:14.877">things</span> <span begin="4:14.877" end="4:15.036">I</span> <span begin="4:15.036" end="4:15.360">hate</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不是我憎恨的事物</span></p><p begin="4:16.313" end="4:18.344" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:16.313" end="4:16.431">Not</span> <span begin="4:16.431" end="4:16.546">the</span> <span begin="4:16.546" end="4:16.708">things</span> <span begin="4:16.708" end="4:16.809">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="4:16.809" end="4:17.248">afraid</span> <span begin="4:17.248" end="4:17.393">of,</span> <span begin="4:17.393" end="4:17.478">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="4:17.478" end="4:17.911">afraid</span> <span begin="4:17.911" end="4:18.344">of</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不是我畏惧的事物 害怕的事物</span></p><p begin="4:19.309" end="4:21.743" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:19.309" end="4:19.463">The</span> <span begin="4:19.463" end="4:19.620">things</span> <span begin="4:19.620" end="4:19.861">that</span> <span begin="4:20.497" end="4:20.792">haunt</span> <span begin="4:20.803" end="4:20.860">me</span> <span begin="4:20.860" end="4:20.917">in</span> <span begin="4:20.917" end="4:21.008">the</span> <span begin="4:21.008" end="4:21.067">mid</span><span begin="4:21.067" end="4:21.143">dle</span> <span begin="4:21.143" end="4:21.198">of</span> <span begin="4:21.198" end="4:21.288">the</span> <span begin="4:21.288" end="4:21.504">night,</span> <span begin="4:21.504" end="4:21.743">I</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也不是让我夜不能寐的事物</span></p><p begin="4:23.738" end="4:24.316" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:23.738" end="4:23.792">I</span> <span begin="4:23.792" end="4:23.980">just</span> <span begin="4:23.980" end="4:24.174">think</span> <span begin="4:24.174" end="4:24.316">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只是觉得</span></p><p begin="4:27.633" end="4:28.809" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:27.633" end="4:27.762">You</span> <span begin="4:27.762" end="4:28.005">are</span> <span begin="4:28.005" end="4:28.142">what</span> <span begin="4:28.142" end="4:28.314">you</span> <span begin="4:28.314" end="4:28.556">lo</span><span begin="4:28.556" end="4:28.809">ve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就是你的所爱</span></p></div></body></tt>